WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
One guided form connects materials and production labour.

00:08.000 --> 00:15.000
Set the base dimensions and separate lid height.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
Invalid quantities hide the price until corrected.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
Choose base and lid materials from the workbook catalogue.

00:28.000 --> 00:40.000
Add foil stamping: its materials and production pass update the quote.

00:40.000 --> 00:50.000
Change the workshop hourly cost. Labour and selling price update together.

00:50.000 --> 01:05.000
Review quantity comparisons, production routes and the process breakdown.
